2,"source_text":"五代梁乾化三年，王景仁侵吴、庐、寿，还渡淮，吴霍丘将朱景潜移其所表之津，置于深渊，梁军望表而涉，溺死甚众。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/二、凤阳府（卷二十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/九、庐州府（卷二十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"周显德五年，南唐以合肥来归。宋大观四年，冀州贼孙琪转寇淮...","context_before":"...史。龙纪初，又陷于蔡州贼将孙儒。景福元年，杨行密复取之。","source_end_index":939,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f6caa155-2c34-5a89-98df-c369ff204994","source_start_index":907,"source_text":"五代梁乾化四年，遣王景仁攻庐、寿二州，吴使徐温等出合肥，御却之。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/九、庐州府（卷二十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"1十二月，吳鎭海節度使徐溫、平盧節度使朱瑾帥諸將拒之，遇于趙步。吳徵兵未集，溫以四千餘人與景仁戰，不勝而卻。景仁引兵乘之，將及於隘，吳吏士皆失色，左驍衞大將軍宛丘陳紹援槍大呼曰：「誘敵太深，可以進矣。」躍馬還鬬，衆隨之，梁兵乃退。溫拊其背曰：「非子之智勇，吾幾困矣。」賜之金帛，紹悉以分麾下。吳兵旣集，復戰於霍丘，梁兵大敗；王景仁以數騎殿，吳人不敢逼。梁之渡淮而南也，表其可涉之津；霍丘守將朱景浮表於木，徙置深淵。及梁兵敗還，望表而涉，溺死者太半，吳人聚梁尸爲京觀於霍丘。","content_fanyi":"十二月，吴国镇海节度使徐温、平卢节度使朱瑾率领众将抵御王景仁，与梁军在赵步相遇。吴国征调的军队尚未集结完毕，徐温率四千余人与王景仁交战，未能取胜而退却。王景仁领兵乘势追击，将要追到险隘处，吴军官兵个个惊慌失色，左骁卫大将军、宛丘人陈绍挺枪大声喊道：“诱敌已经够深了，可以进攻了！”他催马回身接战，部众跟随而上，梁军这才退去。徐温拍着他的背说：“不是靠您的智勇，我几乎要陷入困境了。”徐温赏赐陈绍金帛，陈绍全部分给部下。吴军集结完毕后，又与梁军在霍丘交战，梁军大败；王景仁带着几名骑兵断后，吴军不敢逼近。当梁军渡过淮水南下时，曾标记出可以涉水而过的渡口；吴军霍丘守将朱景把标记设在木头上，让它们浮在水面，再移到深水处。等到梁军战败退回，望见标记涉水渡河，淹死的人超过半数，吴军把梁军尸体收集起来，在霍丘堆成京观。","content_jianti_auto":"1十二月，吴镇海节度使徐温、平卢节度使朱瑾帅诸将拒之，遇于赵步。吴征兵未集，温以四千余人与景仁战，不胜而却。景仁引兵乘之，将及于隘，吴吏士皆失色，左骁衞大将军宛丘陈绍援枪大呼曰：「诱敌太深，可以进矣。」跃马还鬬，众随之，梁兵乃退。温拊其背曰：「非子之智勇，吾几困矣。」赐之金帛，绍悉以分麾下。吴兵既集，复战于霍丘，梁兵大败；王景仁以数骑殿，吴人不敢逼。梁之渡淮而南也，表其可涉之津；霍丘守将朱景浮表于木，徙置深渊。及梁兵败还，望表而涉，溺死者太半，吴人聚梁尸为京观于霍丘。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":27898,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ca66dd38-db0e-11ef-9ec9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"周德威","people_name_jianti_auto":"周德威","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"ca69278b-db0e-11ef-a2e9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李嗣本","people_name_jianti_auto":"李嗣本","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"ca69278c-db0e-11ef-9e41-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"歐","people_name_jianti_auto":"欧","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"ca69278d-db0e-11ef-9e77-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"嗣本","people_name_jianti_auto":"嗣本","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"ca69278e-db0e-11ef-9472-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"张氏","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"ca69278f-db0e-11ef-90c6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"夾寨","place_name_jianti_auto":"夹寨","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"ca692790-db0e-11ef-8a8a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"振武","place_name_jianti_auto":"振武","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"ca692791-db0e-11ef-83df-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"燕","place_name_jianti_auto":"燕","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"ca692792-db0e-11ef-b815-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"盧龍","place_name_jianti_auto":"卢龙","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"ca692793-db0e-11ef-b20d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"振武","place_name_jianti_auto":"振武","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"ca692794-db0e-11ef-810e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鴈門","place_name_jianti_auto":"鴈门","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"ca692795-db0e-11ef-9fbc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"先是，周德威以破夾寨之功帥振武，今以平燕之功徙帥盧龍，以李嗣本代帥振武。歐史·義兒傳，嗣本本鴈門張氏子。","note_content_jianti_auto":"先是，周德威以破夹寨之功帅振武，今以平燕之功徙帅卢龙，以李嗣本代帅振武。欧史·义儿传，嗣本本鴈门张氏子。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"ca69278a-db0e-11ef-a7c2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"盧龍節度使","official_note":"盧龍節度使是唐代至五代時期的地方軍事和行政長官，掌管盧龍地區（今河北北部一帶）的軍政事務。在《資治通鑑》此段中，晉王任命周德威為此職，顯示對其的信任和重用，以加強對該地區的控制。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以周德威爲盧龍節度使","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"49e83f24-44e8-4bfd-a4c2-b001166e3800"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"侍中","official_note":"侍中是唐代至五代時期的高級官職，屬於門下省，負責審核詔令、參與機要決策，常作為加官以示榮寵。在《資治通鑑》此段中，晉王讓周德威兼任侍中，可能意在提升其地位和權威，以輔助節度使職務。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"兼侍中","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"b5fb7091-5db5-4de6-a276-43bbac4cd1e8"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"振武節度使","official_note":"振武節度使是唐代至五代時期的地方軍事和行政長官，掌管振武地區（今內蒙古一帶）的軍政事務。在《資治通鑑》此段中，晉王任命李嗣本為此職，旨在鞏固對邊疆地區的統治和防禦。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以李嗣本爲振武節度使","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"af9e2249-982f-4c03-97f1-adc5e667703c"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":885,"link_death_year":926,"link_td_description":"唐庄宗李存勖，山西应县人，沙陀族，本姓朱邪，因其父是河东节度使李克用受唐懿宗赐姓而改姓李，讳存勖，亦作存勗，唐光启元年正月（885年12月）生于山西应县（一说晋阳宫），五代时期后唐开国皇帝。小名“亚子”，艺名“李天下”，以勇猛闻名。","link_td_id":"Q10000103","link_td_number_id":31338,"people_name":"晉王","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋王","people_xingming":"李存勖","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"ca692797-db0e-11ef-8b40-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[李存勖]"},{"link_death_year":918,"link_td_description":"周德威，字镇远，小名阳五，朔州马邑（今山西朔县）人。","link_td_id":"Q10009813","link_td_number_id":885150,"people_name":"周德威","people_name_jianti_auto":"周德威","people_xingming":"周德威","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"ca692798-db0e-11ef-9c49-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李嗣本","people_name_jianti_auto":"李嗣本","people_xingming":"李嗣本","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"ca692799-db0e-11ef-a515-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"盧龍","place_name_jianti_auto":"卢龙","resolved_place_entity_id":431,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"ca69279a-db0e-11ef-b65e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"振武","place_name_jianti_auto":"振武","resolved_place_entity_id":450,"start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"ca69279b-db0e-11ef-bba5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"后唐灭后梁之战","tongjian_id":"war_N1071"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/六、唐下 五代九国附（卷六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"","context_before":"...[时沧州为守文守也，守光使其子继威据之]。乾化初，称帝。","source_end_index":510,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"beb46b36-b610-5f12-ad85-0be742ec4bea","source_start_index":453,"source_text":"二年，晋遣周德威伐之，东出飞狐[飞狐，见前]，燕境诸州，次第降下[时沧州亦杀其子继威，降于全忠]。三年，为晋所灭。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/六、唐下 五代九国附（卷六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/七、宋上夏附（卷七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"下视孤垒，浃旬必克。山后八州[八州，见石晋燕云十六州注]...","context_before":"...，出安礼寨[在顺天府西南三十里]，则东瞰燕城，才及一舍。","source_end_index":545,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e1111cee-f425-5831-9353-9998fc390051","source_start_index":536,"source_text":"此周德威取燕之路。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/七、宋上夏附（卷七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"2庚午，晉王以周德威爲盧龍節度使，兼侍中，以李嗣本爲振武節度使。","content_fanyi":"庚午日，晋王任命周德威为卢龙节度使、兼任侍中，又任命李嗣本为振武节度使。","content_jianti_auto":"2庚午，晋王以周德威为卢龙节度使，兼侍中，以李嗣本为振武节度使。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":27899,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"ca692789-db0e-11ef-b9c6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"如何撰写宣告胜利的露布","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_CA69279CDB0E11EF93A8A0D3651F611F_02"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"back_reference","source_end_index":16,"source_start_index":12,"source_text":"事見上卷","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ca50ac4d-db0e-11ef-968e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"劉守奇","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘守奇","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ca69279e-db0e-11ef-9e40-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"梁","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"ca69279f-db0e-11ef-b4bf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"滄州","place_name_jianti_auto":"沧州","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"ca6927a0-db0e-11ef-964a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"劉守奇藉兵於梁以取滄州，事見上卷上年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"刘守奇藉兵于梁以取沧州，事见上卷上年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"ca69279d-db0e-11ef-9fd0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"史炤","people_name_jianti_auto":"史炤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ca6927a2-db0e-11ef-aeea-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"史炤曰：釋名曰：腫，鍾也，寒熱氣聚也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史炤曰：释名曰：肿，钟也，寒热气聚也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"ca6927a1-db0e-11ef-9aae-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宋白","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋白","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"ca6927a5-db0e-11ef-b029-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"燕樂縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"燕乐县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ca6927a6-db0e-11ef-af1e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"ca6927a7-db0e-11ef-a8ad-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"白檀","place_name_jianti_auto":"白檀","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"ca6927a8-db0e-11ef-bc24-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"ca6927a9-db0e-11ef-bc53-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"新興城","place_name_jianti_auto":"新兴城","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"ca6927aa-db0e-11ef-9621-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"檀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"檀州","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"ca6927ab-db0e-11ef-9611-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"燕樂","place_name_jianti_auto":"燕乐","place_note":"北京市密云县东北","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"ca6927ac-db0e-11ef-a9cb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"密雲","place_name_jianti_auto":"密云","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"ca6927ad-db0e-11ef-8b37-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"ca6927ae-db0e-11ef-991e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"虒奚縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"虒奚县","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"ca6927af-db0e-11ef-82a3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"燕樂縣，後魏置，治白檀古城。唐長壽二年徙治新興城，屬檀州。宋白曰：燕樂、密雲二縣皆漢虒奚縣地。樂，音洛。","note_content_jianti_auto":"燕乐县，后魏置，治白檀古城。唐长寿二年徙治新兴城，属檀州。宋白曰：燕乐、密云二县皆汉虒奚县地。乐，音洛。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"ca6927a4-db0e-11ef-99fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ca6927b3-db0e-11ef-a3db-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","place_note":"首都太原府【山西省太原市】","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"ca6927b4-db0e-11ef-ba4e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"魏、晉以來，每戰勝則書捷狀，建之漆竿，使天下皆知之，謂之露布。露布者，暴白其事而布告天下，未嘗書之於布而使人曳之也。文心雕龍曰：露布者，蓋露板不封，布諸觀聽也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"魏、晋以来，每战胜则书捷状，建之漆竿，使天下皆知之，谓之露布。露布者，暴白其事而布告天下，未尝书之于布而使人曳之也。文心雕龙曰：露布者，盖露板不封，布诸观听也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":150,"tongjian_id":"ca6927b2-db0e-11ef-8699-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"掌書記","official_note":"掌書記是負責文書起草和記錄的官職，常見於唐代及五代時期，通常隸屬於節度使或高級將領，負責處理軍政文書。在上下文中，晉王命令掌書記王緘起草露布（一種公開的軍事捷報），顯示該官職在傳達命令和文書工作中的角色。此信息基於《資治通鑑》原文和歷史常識。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"王命掌書記王緘草露布","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"7dc04af4-06ba-4479-adc7-d6a1b57b3b08"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":914,"link_td_description":"刘守光，深州（今河北深州）人，五代时期燕国建立者，为幽州节度使刘仁恭之子，发动兵变，夺父位自立，又称帝。后被李存勖讨伐，斩杀。","link_td_id":"Q10000411","link_td_number_id":215903,"people_name":"守光","people_name_jianti_auto":"守光","people_xingming":"刘守光","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"ca6927b6-db0e-11ef-9749-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"劉守奇","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘守奇","people_xingming":"刘守奇","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"ca6927b7-db0e-11ef-b4a6-a0d3